        "description": "This is not a gambling product and does not provide an opportunity to win real money. 18+ only. Please play responsibly.\n\nPokerStars presents Vegas Infinite, a world of entertainment with no limits. Challenge friends and players all over the globe and play electrifying poker, blackjack, roulette, craps, and slots.\n\nLeap into breath-taking environments with intuitive chip, dice, and card movements. Study players’ tells and chat in real time just like in live games.\n\nLight up the tables with an endless supply of interactive props and dress to impress with a giant collection of customizable accessories and apparel.\n\nYour big night out just got bigger. We’ve saved you a seat.\n\nVegas Infinite also features Quest Pro support, with face and eye tracking, advanced haptics, and mixed reality passthrough.\n\nPlease note that we will no longer offer support for Quest 1, effective October 18, 2023.\n\nAccess to IAP may be restricted by location.\n\nVegas Infinite VOIP is monitored by ToxMod.",
